Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1005,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1773887,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":265407,"Name":"KWandCM","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265407.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":244,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1372601091,"LastPoster":{"Id":275126,"Name":"Rainmaker","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275126.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":67,"Preview":{"Id":1773887,"PostDate":1372601091,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies,  \u00a0  I couldn't find this anywhere else on the forum so my apologies if it has been as...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmandkw2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.61.12.40","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359595506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265407.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":244,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KWandCM","Id":265407,"Name":"KWandCM","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74445,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9493ac23e82d131bbefc0f3ac5e1968a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I couldn&#039;t find this anywhere else on the forum so my apologies if it has been asked &amp;amp; answered before.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am hoping to fly in my own photographer. A friend of a friend does a lot of weddings locally and is willing to give us quite a good deal in exchange for paying for his flight, accommodation, and a little bit extra. We will get a lot more for our money this way and I&#039;m pretty sure this is the route I want to go.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Has anyone else flown in their own photographer? I believe I&#039;ve seen a few other ladies do that here. If so, what kind of contract terms did you make sure to have? He&#039;s writing it up but I want to make sure I don&#039;t miss anything that should be included before I sign. For some reason I feel like having him fly there makes it a little bit more risky in some ways then booking a local photographer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks for sharing your experiences!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1773887,"PostDate":1372601091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I couldn't find this anywhere else on the forum so my apologies if it has been asked & answered before.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am hoping to fly in my own photographer. A friend of a friend does a lot of weddings locally and is willing to give us quite a good deal in exchange for paying for his flight, accommodation, and a little bit extra. We will get a lot more for our money this way and I'm pretty sure this is the route I want to go.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Has anyone else flown in their own photographer? I believe I've seen a few other ladies do that here. If so, what kind of contract terms did you make sure to have? He's writing it up but I want to make sure I don't miss anything that should be included before I sign. For some reason I feel like having him fly there makes it a little bit more risky in some ways then booking a local photographer.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for sharing your experiences!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmandkw2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.61.12.40","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359595506,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265407.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":244,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KWandCM","Id":265407,"Name":"KWandCM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74445,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b5036220eb9d1bc15e256102fa12306","RawContent":"Hi Krista, \n \n We did this for our wedding photography. She had us sign her standard contract, which included terms about payment (deposit + final), rights to photography, timing it&#039;d be delivered, and what was included in the package (# of hours, album, # &amp;amp; size prints, albums, online slideshow, etc.). Because she was a friend, we didn&#039;t modify her contract to include travel, we kept it to an informal understanding between us.  \n \n I would first review their standard contract. If it&#039;s not included, I&#039;d recommend adding in the travel clause - how many days at the resort you&#039;re paying for (e.g. you&#039;ll pay for 3 days, they can choose to stay longer at their own expense), and what that includes (gratuities?). I&#039;d also add in that you will pay for the lowest available airfare, and any additional airfare costs (different flight times, luggage fees, direct vs. layover, upgrades, etc) would be the responsibility of the photographer. If you decide to include luggage fees, then you can move it around from not included to included - just base it on what you agree to pay.  \n \n Hope that helps!  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KWandCM[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies, \n \n I couldn&#039;t find this anywhere else on the forum so my apologies if it has been asked &amp;amp; answered before. \n \n I am hoping to fly in my own photographer. A friend of a friend does a lot of weddings locally and is willing to give us quite a good deal in exchange for paying for his flight, accommodation, and a little bit extra. We will get a lot more for our money this way and I&#039;m pretty sure this is the route I want to go. \n \n Has anyone else flown in their own photographer? I believe I&#039;ve seen a few other ladies do that here. If so, what kind of contract terms did you make sure to have? He&#039;s writing it up but I want to make sure I don&#039;t miss anything that should be included before I sign. For some reason I feel like having him fly there makes it a little bit more risky in some ways then booking a local photographer.  \n \n Thanks for sharing your experiences![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1773961,"PostDate":1372617265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Krista,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We did this for our wedding photography. She had us sign her standard contract, which included terms about payment (deposit + final), rights to photography, timing it'd be delivered, and what was included in the package (# of hours, album, # & size prints, albums, online slideshow, etc.). Because she was a friend, we didn't modify her contract to include travel, we kept it to an informal understanding between us.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would first review their standard contract. If it's not included, I'd recommend adding in the travel clause - how many days at the resort you're paying for (e.g. you'll pay for 3 days, they can choose to stay longer at their own expense), and what that includes (gratuities?). I'd also add in that you will pay for the lowest available airfare, and any additional airfare costs (different flight times, luggage fees, direct vs. layover, upgrades, etc) would be the responsibility of the photographer. If you decide to include luggage fees, then you can move it around from not included to included - just base it on what you agree to pay.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps!\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KWandCM<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I couldn't find this anywhere else on the forum so my apologies if it has been asked & answered before.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am hoping to fly in my own photographer. A friend of a friend does a lot of weddings locally and is willing to give us quite a good deal in exchange for paying for his flight, accommodation, and a little bit extra. We will get a lot more for our money this way and I'm pretty sure this is the route I want to go.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Has anyone else flown in their own photographer? I believe I've seen a few other ladies do that here. If so, what kind of contract terms did you make sure to have? He's writing it up but I want to make sure I don't miss anything that should be included before I sign. For some reason I feel like having him fly there makes it a little bit more risky in some ways then booking a local photographer.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for sharing your experiences!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"myEventWatcherDiv\"  style=\"display:none\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309661480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.76.163.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74445,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by megthomson, 03 January 2014 - 10:31 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1388817077,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"460f67fdc5bdf44bd0bedff050695f5f","RawContent":"Great thread!  We are bringing our own too.  Thanks for Info above!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1822356,"PostDate":1388817048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great thread!  We are bringing our own too.  Thanks for Info above!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megthomson78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.76.163.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388756798,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275858.jpg?_r=1394079727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megthomson","Id":275858,"Name":"megthomson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.246.2.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74445,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"737e149b6fe2343d3ecbb8c268362b30","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am flying in my photographer...didn&#039;t even think about the luggage fees.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826686,"PostDate":1389902919,"PostC