Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"297ed73d58cba94c519a6779e135be4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much Wendy for responding! I got a hold of Tammy and she is currently helping me.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Have a great time at Playa Del Carmen :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cheers,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Azadeh&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1245657,"PostDate":1281133601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much Wendy for responding! I got a hold of Tammy and she is currently helping me.<\/p> <p> Have a great time at Playa Del Carmen <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cheers,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Azadeh<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherazi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1280852091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230973.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cherazi","Id":230973,"Name":"Cherazi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c51e59905086a931d05f002271e5a0a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sounds great, Azadeh, you are in expert hands!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Today I checked out The Grand Palladium Resort and also visited Dreams Tulum... I got amazing pictures, (well, my husband did), and I will be posting LOTS of hotel reviews when I get home!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best wishes,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1246187,"PostDate":1281216834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sounds great, Azadeh, you are in expert hands!<\/p> <p> Today I checked out The Grand Palladium Resort and also visited Dreams Tulum... I got amazing pictures, (well, my husband did), and I will be posting LOTS of hotel reviews when I get home!<\/p> <p> Best wishes,<\/p> <p> TA Wendy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69242529a87fdd0bce9754e13be364a1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]thefuturemrslutz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi girls, if anyone is looking for a destination wedding travel agent, I would like to recommend Wendy Hicks!! She is AMAZING!!!!! After dealing with at least 4 or 5 travel agents, I finally found my travel agent aka travel angel. She has made everything extremely easy and has bent over backwards for my fiance and me...including answering ALL of our questions with great detail and honesty. She is quick to respond and ALWAYS tries to meet my requests. I honestly do not know how I would get through these past few months without her. She even got all my guests booked and paid in full 2 months BEFORE the wedding!!!! THANKS SO MUCH WENDY!!!!!!!![img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif[\/img][\/quote] \n \n \n I 100% agree!! Wendy Hicks is amazing!! Every one of our guests who dealt with Wendy directly raved about her. All said she was extremely nice and helpful. We had guests traveling from around the world (Portland, LA, NYC, all around Mexico, Spain, Germany, Chile... ) and Wendy was extremely helpful and accommodating. She was very patient with changes and after hour phone calls (tough work coordinating 95 people). Wendy was just so kind and personable!  The rate Wendy got us through American Express travel was as good and better than any other prices we saw (and our guests shopped around). The hotel rates also included transfers to and from the hotel, which was GREAT for our guests.","Attachments":[],"Id":1332384,"PostDate":1289158578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>thefuturemrslutz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi girls, if anyone is looking for a destination wedding travel agent, I would like to recommend Wendy Hicks!! She is AMAZING!!!!! After dealing with at least 4 or 5 travel agents, I finally found my travel agent aka travel angel. She has made everything extremely easy and has bent over backwards for my fiance and me...including answering ALL of our questions with great detail and honesty. She is quick to respond and ALWAYS tries to meet my requests. I honestly do not know how I would get through these past few months without her. She even got all my guests booked and paid in full 2 months BEFORE the wedding!!!! THANKS SO MUCH WENDY!!!!!!!!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" title=\"Cheer2\" \/><\/span><\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I 100% agree!! Wendy Hicks is amazing!! Every one of our guests who dealt with Wendy directly raved about her. All said she was extremely nice and helpful. We had guests traveling from around the world (Portland, LA, NYC, all around Mexico, Spain, Germany, Chile... ) and Wendy was extremely helpful and accommodating. She was very patient with changes and after hour phone calls (tough work coordinating 95 people). Wendy was just so kind and personable!\u00a0 The rate Wendy got us through American Express travel was as good and better than any other prices we saw (and our guests shopped around). The hotel rates also included transfers to and from the hotel, which was GREAT for our guests.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anb32@columbia.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1283379909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231961.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alib0160","Id":231961,"Name":"alib0160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce9f9defa342ca999f20f589f32a6d6a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Agreed! &amp;nbsp;Wendy was an integral part of our decision to have a destination wedding!! &amp;nbsp;Her timeliness and responsiveness with emails and phone calls (while we were on separate coasts!) was so reassuring. &amp;nbsp;We had around 65 guests who attended our wedding, and it could not have been possible without Wendy! &amp;nbsp;She also worked very hard secretly with my husband to book our honeymoon travel, and could not have been more helpful! We love Wendy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1370816,"PostDate":1294343625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Agreed! \u00a0Wendy was an integral part of our decision to have a destination wedding!! \u00a0Her timeliness and responsiveness with emails and phone calls (while we were on separate coasts!) was so reassuring. \u00a0We had around 65 guests who attended our wedding, and it could not have been possible without Wendy! \u00a0She also worked very hard secretly with my husband to book our honeymoon travel, and could not have been more helpful! We love Wendy!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyeftich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264290297,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224982.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tyeftich","Id":224982,"Name":"tyeftich","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64a1ac54c38d32c4c6ba7847855ecd93","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ahhh, you guys, thank you so much! I love what I do, and I love working with wedding couples and guests! Everyone is so excited and happy to be going, and I always know that if my part of the process makes it a little easier, and less stressful for the wedding couple, I have done my job!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1371552,"PostDate":1294426228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ahhh, you guys, thank you so much! I love what I do, and I love working with wedding couples and guests! Everyone is so excited and happy to be going, and I always know that if my part of the process makes it a little easier, and less stressful for the wedding couple, I have done my job!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bb33f9a49487c9d34b73a6e6786fb1e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am currently working with Wendy also and she has been a great help!&amp;nbsp; It is so nice to know that my guests are being taken care of!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1371607,"PostDate":1294429021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am currently working with Wendy also and she has been a great help!\u00a0 It is so nice to know that my guests are being taken care of!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alisa.dales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1284528183,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232351.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"adales","Id":232351,"Name":"adales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6e437fee595a9c0ed75007beefed631","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Agreed! Wendy has been so great to work with! I may not have a wedding date if it weren&#039;t for her stepping in to help get a reply from the resort!! Thanks again Wendy!!! Excited to get my invites out&amp;nbsp;before the end of the month&amp;nbsp;hopefully,&amp;nbsp;so our guests can start contacting you! &lt;span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1371641,"PostDate":1294430577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Agreed! Wendy has been so great to work with! I may not have a wedding date if it weren't for her stepping in to help get a reply from the resort!! Thanks again Wendy!!! Excited to get my invites out\u00a0before the end of the month\u00a0hopefully,\u00a0so our guests can start contacting you! <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a2853d79549ebd797f2c7741ca36bee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, Wendy sounds amazing! I will be contacting her once I &amp;quot;offically&amp;quot; get engaged!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390084,"PostDate":1296753594,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, Wendy sounds amazing! I will be contacting her once I \"offically\" get engaged!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294263874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d12e9219324ae4c0f4079c3cd288603","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wendy recently got our rates adjusted even lower than our original contracted price.&amp;nbsp; Her dedication is priceless!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390090,"PostDate":1296753836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wendy recently got our rates adjusted even lower than our original contracted price.\u00a0 Her dedication is priceless!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alisa.dales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1284528183,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232351.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"adales","Id":232351,"Name":"adales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9805b351236e271025255f3dc68f934","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we have some great agents here on BDW.&amp;nbsp; rarely do you hear any complaints about TA Wendy, TA Teresa, TA Patty or TA JT.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; they all have stellar customer service and knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390205,"PostDate":1296759187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we have some great agents here on BDW.\u00a0 rarely do you hear any complaints about TA Wendy, TA Teresa, TA Patty or TA JT.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> they all have stellar customer service and knowledge.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":55,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
