he photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571479,"PostDate":1327190737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> any suggestions on a photographer to use for a los cabos wedding? if you know the prices to pls post them. and if you have used the photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angeleyez0007@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327075735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250247.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashleyrm","Id":250247,"Name":"ashleyrm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"168b6499456b3349db3372171b35ef67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, Ashley.&amp;nbsp; Check out the photographer reviews below.&amp;nbsp; Also, if you look at the advertisements on your right you will see BDW featured photographer sponsers.&amp;nbsp; I suggest contacting those whose work you like and requesting pricing.&amp;nbsp; Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/photographer-videographer\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/photographer-videographer&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571496,"PostDate":1327198838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, Ashley.\u00a0 Check out the photographer reviews below.\u00a0 Also, if you look at the advertisements on your right you will see BDW featured photographer sponsers.\u00a0 I suggest contacting those whose work you like and requesting pricing.\u00a0 Happy planning!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/photographer-videographer' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...er-videographer<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168253040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ef8dd62deaf94fb495db99ea972cb6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Check out Juan Carlos Tapia! His work is awesome, He will be doing our wedding on March 1, 2013. His website is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\"&gt;www.juancarlostapia.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; He gives you all the images on a dvd so you can do whatever you want with them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571675,"PostDate":1327258964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Check out Juan Carlos Tapia! His work is awesome, He will be doing our wedding on March 1, 2013. His website is <a href='http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.juancarlostapia.com<\/a><\/p> <p> He gives you all the images on a dvd so you can do whatever you want with them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellewilbur@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.161.51.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325074519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248997.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":104,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mlw02","Id":248997,"Name":"mlw02","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ea9f973dced67dda25ceab37062d22e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; ashleyrm,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m using Dino Gomez www.dinogomez.com as my photographer, we have him for Sep 14, 2012. Who are you using for flowers, I can&#039;t find someone I like?? Also who are you using for transportation, the ones I&#039;ve found are crazy expensive!?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thankz&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Amanda&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575692,"PostDate":1327943665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ashleyrm,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm using Dino Gomez www.dinogomez.com as my photographer, we have him for Sep 14, 2012. Who are you using for flowers, I can't find someone I like?? Also who are you using for transportation, the ones I've found are crazy expensive!?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thankz<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Amanda<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"AmyRogz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1327941204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AmyRogz","Id":250732,"Name":"AmyRogz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"309080568d494bba63292c78bff5229d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; EM Weddings is a sponsor on BDW...here is their site:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.emweddings.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.emweddings.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575710,"PostDate":1327945918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> EM Weddings is a sponsor on BDW...here is their site:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.emweddings.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.emweddings.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137206220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4280b30301afa072ea2b927607ca33f5","RawContent":"There are some fantastic wedding photographers here in Los Cabos. The low end for photography is around $300\/hour and the high end is around $800\/hour depending on how many hours you book with the photographers, if you do a package, the season and if you do a week day vs. a weekend. We have a list of preferred vendors based on their quality, client experiences, style, accountability and reliability. Photographers have become a dime a dozen here in Los Cabos, so do your homework and find the perfect one for you, we have a some great one&#039;s no doubt!. ~Kym \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ashleyrm[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n any suggestions on a photographer to use for a los cabos wedding? if you know the prices to pls post them. and if you have used the photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1576216,"PostDate":1328018555,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> There are some fantastic wedding photographers here in Los Cabos. The low end for photography is around $300\/hour and the high end is around $800\/hour depending on how many hours you book with the photographers, if you do a package, the season and if you do a week day vs. a weekend. We have a list of preferred vendors based on their quality, client experiences, style, accountability and reliability. Photographers have become a dime a dozen here in Los Cabos, so do your homework and find the perfect one for you, we have a some great one's no doubt!. ~Kym<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ashleyrm<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> any suggestions on a photographer to use for a los cabos wedding? if you know the prices to pls post them. and if you have used the photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kym@blissloscabos.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1261521040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Blissloscabos","Id":224064,"Name":"Blissloscabos","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee6fca45e5714c21e138114f96b94717","RawContent":"Our photographer was Gonzalo Verdeja from ArtnColors. He&#039;s on here if you do a search for artncolors. His website is also artncolors.com. You can see some of the photos I posted from our wedding here: \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77209\/puccas-wedding-and-ttd-photos\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77209\/puccas-wedding-and-ttd-photos[\/url] \n \n These might be some of the same ones but here are some as well: \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/44947\/post-your-happiest-wedding-day-photo\/280#post_1708889\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/44947\/post-your-happiest-wedding-day-photo\/280#post_1708889[\/url] \n \n We absolutely loved working with him! And everyone loved our pictures--not just us! :)  Good luck!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ashleyrm[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n any suggestions on a photographer to use for a los cabos wedding? if you know the prices to pls post them. and if you have used the photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1583843,"PostDate":1329529194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Our photographer was Gonzalo Verdeja from ArtnColors. He's on here if you do a search for artncolors. His website is also artncolors.com. You can see some of the photos I posted from our wedding here:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77209\/puccas-wedding-and-ttd-photos' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-and-ttd-photos<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These might be some of the same ones but here are some as well:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/44947\/post-your-happiest-wedding-day-photo\/280#post_1708889' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...80#post_1708889<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We absolutely loved working with him! And everyone loved our pictures--not just us! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Good luck!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ashleyrm<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> any suggestions on a photographer to use for a los cabos wedding? if you know the prices to pls post them. and if you have used the photographer pls post a few pics or a link to their website. thanks!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"euneeq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1292604564,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234669.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pucca","Id":234669,"Name":"Pucca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.164.101.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad2e1cb4467521041ac7875b94958638","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We also chose Gonzalo Verdeja to photograph our wedding. He did an incredible job and is a highly creative and talented photographer. He is clearly very passionate about his art and was able to capture some really great moments of the wedding ceremony. Gonzalo was very professional and personable as well. My wife and I and our familes were very impressed with the pictures. They are memories we will cherish forever. Here is his website:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893526,"PostDate":1429321917,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We also chose Gonzalo Verdeja to photograph our wedding. He did an incredible job and is a highly creative and talented photographer. He is clearly very passionate about his art and was able to capture some really great moments of the wedding ceremony. Gonzalo was very professional and personable as well. My wife and I and our familes were very impressed with the pictures. They are memories we will cherish forever. Here is his website:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miketothed35@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.164.101.145","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429321292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MikeyD","Id":282780,"Name":"MikeyD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"562ac078f73d94c640292f913e11b667","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Blissloscabos\" post=\"1576216\" timestamp=\"1328036555\"]\nThere are some fantastic wedding photographers here in Los Cabos. The low end for photography is around $300\/hour and the high end is around $800\/hour depending on how many hours you book with the photographers, if you do a package, the season and if you do a week day vs. a weekend. We have a list of preferred vendors based on their quality, client experiences, style, accountability and reliability. Photographers have become a dime a dozen here in Los Cabos, so do your homework and find the perfect one for you, we have a some great one&#039;s no doubt!. ~Kym\n\n[\/quote]\n@[member=\"ashleyrm\"] with prices that high you may also want to consider bringing in your own destination wedding photographer. We brought our own photographer at a fraction of the price of what the resort photographer would have cost.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893967,"PostDate":1429715950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Blissloscabos, on 31 January 2012 - 02:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\nThere are some fantastic wedding photographers here in Los Cabos. The low end for photography is around $300\/hour and the high end is around $800\/hour depending on how many hours you book with the photographers, if you do a package, the season and if you do a week day vs. a weekend. We have a list of preferred vendors based on their quality, client experiences, style, accountability and reliability. Photographers have become a dime a dozen here in Los Cabos, so do your homework and find the perfect one for you, we have a some great one's no doubt!. ~Kym<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250247\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250247-ashleyrm\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashleyrm<\/span><\/a> with prices that high you may also want to consider bringing in your own destination wedding photographer. We brought our own photographer at a fraction of the price of what the resort photographer would have cost.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419927157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.71.23.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65433,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd83b86aebf9d12b9382637eb04258c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone ever used Alec and T? They do beautiful pictures but I have heard they are on the upper end of pricing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905053,"PostDate":1442667273,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone ever used Alec and T? They do beautiful pictures but I have heard they are on the upper end of pricing.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlyn.olsen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.71.23.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442662771,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284866.jpg?_r=1442683147","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sierra123","Id":284866,"Name":"sierra123","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"65433","Title":"cabo photographers","LastPostDate":1442667273},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
