\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847483,"PostDate":1398805387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What are the more affordable wedding flowers in Mexico? I read in a thread peonies are expensive there...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397422022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbc87e98e894e873d0dec83cb23b2ca8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was wondering the same thing. I really like alstroemerias (Peruvian lilies) because they are delicate and have a lot of color to them. I know they have Mexican Lilies there, but I&#039;m not too big on them...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847568,"PostDate":1398853441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was wondering the same thing. I really like alstroemerias (Peruvian lilies) because they are delicate and have a lot of color to them. I know they have Mexican Lilies there, but I'm not too big on them...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/beach-wedding-dreams-riviera-cancun-tj\/'>My wedding pictures from Del Sol Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396262519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.238.251.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfd816cd0f945438c3c5fa7331ad4829","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was recently married in riveria maya.&amp;nbsp; I decided to go with a florist not associated with the resort- marvin from maya floral.&amp;nbsp; His prices were amazing and I suggest you check him out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul beach (where I was married) is associated with Lomas travel.&amp;nbsp; Lomas wanted to charge $350 for my bouquet. $225 for the bridesmaids and $250 for centerpieces.&amp;nbsp; They said the reason they were so expensive was bc I wanted orchids and hydrangeas and they are imported flowers.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maya floral charged- $170 for my bouquet, $65 bridesmaids, $75 or $85 for centerpieces (can&#039;t remember)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;I was told the cheapest flowers in mexico are roses, lilies, and gerber daisies&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847665,"PostDate":1398873899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was recently married in riveria maya.\u00a0 I decided to go with a florist not associated with the resort- marvin from maya floral.\u00a0 His prices were amazing and I suggest you check him out.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul beach (where I was married) is associated with Lomas travel.\u00a0 Lomas wanted to charge $350 for my bouquet. $225 for the bridesmaids and $250 for centerpieces.\u00a0 They said the reason they were so expensive was bc I wanted orchids and hydrangeas and they are imported flowers.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maya floral charged- $170 for my bouquet, $65 bridesmaids, $75 or $85 for centerpieces (can't remember)<\/p>\n<br \/><p>I was told the cheapest flowers in mexico are roses, lilies, and gerber daisies<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talicea7812@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.237.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387556554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275695.jpg?_r=1398892094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"talicea7812","Id":275695,"Name":"talicea7812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f61a0f954353e64f56d848327dff8c5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"talicea7812\"] Congrats! Did they deliver to the resort? Did the resort charge a vendor fee?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847711,"PostDate":1398886955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275695\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275695-talicea7812\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">talicea7812<\/span><\/a> Congrats! Did they deliver to the resort? Did the resort charge a vendor fee?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397422022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.34.92.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb387676274a35d3d29a72d8173b2da1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did not pay an outside vendor fee.&amp;nbsp; Maya Floral was able to deliver the flowers right to the lobby.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t think Azul was very happy about it but they permitted it.&amp;nbsp; when the flowers were delivered my husband and groomsmen picked them up in the lobby and took them to the wedding offices. Everything was already assembled.&amp;nbsp; I didn&#039;t choose anything thing crazy bc Azul would charge an arm and a leg if they had to do any assembly.&amp;nbsp; All they had to do was place them on the tables.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So happy with the results and I saved soooo much.&amp;nbsp; I thought about fake flowers but then I would have to bring them down with me...and really? what would I do with it after?&amp;nbsp; it would just sit around collecting dust bc I would feel bad throwing it out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847792,"PostDate":1398934727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did not pay an outside vendor fee.\u00a0 Maya Floral was able to deliver the flowers right to the lobby.\u00a0 I don't think Azul was very happy about it but they permitted it.\u00a0 when the flowers were delivered my husband and groomsmen picked them up in the lobby and took them to the wedding offices. Everything was already assembled.\u00a0 I didn't choose anything thing crazy bc Azul would charge an arm and a leg if they had to do any assembly.\u00a0 All they had to do was place them on the tables.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So happy with the results and I saved soooo much.\u00a0 I thought about fake flowers but then I would have to bring them down with me...and really? what would I do with it after?\u00a0 it would just sit around collecting dust bc I would feel bad throwing it out.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talicea7812@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.237.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387556554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275695.jpg?_r=1398892094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"talicea7812","Id":275695,"Name":"talicea7812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a408564f3ca5fc2fc3b2805c69ce3657","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"talicea7812\"] Do you have the contact info for the florist you used?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847969,"PostDate":1399025889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275695\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275695-talicea7812\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">talicea7812<\/span><\/a> Do you have the contact info for the florist you used?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nina1116@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391424248,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nina1116","Id":276467,"Name":"nina1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.238.251.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64e053cd13dc04325b816450a7241b39","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Marvin&#039;s website is&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.mayafloral.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;email&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:marvin@mayafloral.com&#039;&gt;marvin@mayafloral.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nina1116\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848039,"PostDate":1399046641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Marvin's website is<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.mayafloral.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>email<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:marvin@mayafloral.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>marvin@mayafloral.com<\/a><\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276467-nina1116\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nina1116<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talicea7812@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.237.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387556554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275695.jpg?_r=1398892094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"talicea7812","Id":275695,"Name":"talicea7812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.186.151.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by LissaSou, 13 May 2014 - 01:08 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1399986518,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fb1aac2b5c8baab120df563ae0b78fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"talicea7812\"] - I&#039;ve been contemplating getting an outside vendor for the bouquets and didn&#039;t know where to start looking.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850113,"PostDate":1399986502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275695\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275695-talicea7812\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">talicea7812<\/span><\/a> - I've been contemplating getting an outside vendor for the bouquets and didn't know where to start looking.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tebbswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.146.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391029409,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276400.jpg?_r=1396405141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LissaSou","Id":276400,"Name":"LissaSou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"850960284584f399b4ae6a9f4ee2ef98","RawContent":"[quote name=\"talicea7812\" post=\"1848039\" timestamp=\"1399064641\"]\nMarvin&#039;s website is\n\nwww.mayafloral.com\n\nemail\n[email=\"marvin@mayafloral.com\"]marvin@mayafloral.com[\/email]\n\n@[member=\"nina1116\"][\/quote]Thanks @[member=\"talicea7812\"]!! I will check him out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1853786,"PostDate":1401873221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>talicea7812, on 02 May 2014 - 04:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Marvin's website is<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.mayafloral.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>email<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:marvin@mayafloral.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>marvin@mayafloral.com<\/a><\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276467-nina1116\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nina1116<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thanks\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275695\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275695-talicea7812\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">talicea7812<\/span><\/a>!! I will check him out.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nina1116@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391424248,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nina1116","Id":276467,"Name":"nina1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52e2709bc3dbd5d6eef61b50fe926103","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was quoted $50\/orchid, so I am going with real touch (which is also pricey for orchids!). &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855123,"PostDate":1402672838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was quoted $50\/orchid, so I am going with real touch (which is also pricey for orchids!). \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387567052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"