parse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/s\/dreams\/2008\/october\/leia\/index.html\">Our Engagement Slideshow<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=gelvkrySKaw\">Our Wedding Video<\/a><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ycwSTNzJJ6c\">Our Wedding Slideshow...on youtube<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Lantonio@rnmail.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1189819860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207736.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Leia78","Id":207736,"Name":"Leia78","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11801,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"395ef3602c1a6b75e18f8229c8d474b9","RawContent":"I have been going through a lot of ideas for my table numbers. But I think I am set on taking several pictures of my dog in various mexican\/fiesta\/hawaiian costumes and photoshopping them to state the table number. I think it&#039;ll be so cute...we wanted a way to incorporate him in our wedding, since he won&#039;t be able to be there with us. I&#039;ll post pics when I&#039;m done with this project. Here&#039;s a pic of him in a tux:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i113.photobucket.com\/albums\/n239\/lantonio1978\/BubbainaTuxedo.jpg?t=1203881297\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Here is a sample to give you guys an idea...there&#039;s some details I&#039;m going to change and it&#039;s in a low resolution jpeg, so it&#039;s not as clear.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/get_convo_image.php?convo