-7138-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7138-pomegranate[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7176-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7176-pomegranate[\/url]\nall in pomegrante\nI love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves. \nThe girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH\"]http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH[\/url]\n\nStill working on accessories for them  :wub:[\/quote]\nI love the colour! I didn&#039;t even know pomegranate existed! lol but I really like it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878681,"PostDate":1416341016,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TiffanyMC, on 17 November 2014 - 11:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What styles\/colors are your bm's wearing?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My MOH will wear:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...43s-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaids:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7172-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...172-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7138-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...138-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7176-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...176-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>all in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>I love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&productRef=SEARCH' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/s...oductRef=SEARCH<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still working on accessories for them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the colour! I didn't even know pomegranate existed! lol but I really like it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","Phot