iv><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361719826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cda299190c555466af1d262e59c7d284","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TiffanyMC\" post=\"1878631\" timestamp=\"1416286521\"]\nWhat styles\/colors are your bm&#039;s wearing?\n\nMy MOH will wear: [url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate[\/url]\nin pomegrante\n\nBridesmaids:\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7172-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7172-pomegranate[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7138-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7138-pomegranate[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7176-pomegranate\"]http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&amp;amp;sku=aa-7176-pomegranate[\/url]\nall in pomegrante\nI love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves. \nThe girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH\"]http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&amp;amp;productRef=SEARCH[\/url]\n\nStill working on accessories for them  :wub:[\/quote]\nGreat prices and dresses!!!  Where was this site when I searched hi and low LOL!!!\n\nAwesome choices :)\n\nThis is what my bridesmaids are wearing... the color is Begonia and it&#039;s from David&#039;s Bridal.\n\n[img]http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/download_zps1504857d.png[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1878834,"PostDate":1416523120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TiffanyMC, on 17 November 2014 - 11:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What styles\/colors are your bm's wearing?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My MOH will wear:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7243s-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7243s-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...43s-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaids:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7172-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7172-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...172-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7138-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7138-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...138-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingtonway.com\/products\/alfred-angelo-7176-bridesmaid-dress?&sku=aa-7176-pomegranate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingto...176-pomegranate<\/a><\/p>\n<p>all in pomegrante<\/p>\n<p>I love that the dresses are all a little different much like my girls themselves.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The girls all really liked the same shoe so I purchased these sandals for them...<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/shoe\/chinese+laundry+glisten+flat+sandal?prodId=312092&productRef=SEARCH' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dsw.com\/s...oductRef=SEARCH<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still working on accessories for them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Great prices and dresses!!! \u00a0Where was this site when I searched hi and low LOL!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Awesome choices <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>This is what my bridesmaids are wearing... the color is Begonia and it's from David's Bridal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/download_zps1504857d.png\" alt=\"download_zps1504857d.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3576bc1610194c5b4c77514c3fbc6bef","RawContent":"So many beautiful dresses. I actually found mine at sears :) \n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/m.sears.ca\/product\/jolie-strapless-bridesmaid-dress-in-chiffon\/648-000148908-8871&#03