{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b04ff24e8091df59fc828b783a944a79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for the information.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547453,"PostDate":1321485289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much for the information.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ginnie@rochester.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321411732,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247716.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"delmarchic","Id":247716,"Name":"delmarchic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7c862cc39974b28a2bca9bb1a4b2333","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Wendy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am a newbie member to Best Destination Weddings.com and recently engaged 2 weeks ago!!! &amp;nbsp;I have read so many amazing things about you that I was hoping I could reach out to you to help us put together our destination wedding package in April 2013. From the sounds of it you are THE GURU &amp;amp; we would love to work with you if you would have us!   &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are looking to return to the Riu Palace Riviera Maya. &amp;nbsp;We vacationed there in April of 2010 with 4 other couples &amp;amp; absolutely loved it! &amp;nbsp;We anticipate a large group &amp;amp; really would like to get our information out there in good enough time so our family &amp;amp; friends can SAVE THE DATE and SAVE SOME MONEY and join us! &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just sent a note to the wedding planner at the Riu Palace Riviera Maya last night to look into availability. &amp;nbsp;We know we want to go for a week in April 2013, we just need to confirm WHICH WEEK, my future stepson&#039;s Easter\/School break in 2013 will fall on. &amp;nbsp;Although Easter 2013 is Sunday March 31st, the school indicates they are unsure that the break will be that week of April 1st - 5th. &amp;nbsp;I should know by March at the latest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I hope to hear from you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Many thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Elissa (&amp;amp; Bill)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; elissae@nycap.rr.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Clifton Park, NY&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Bill &amp;amp; I Riu 2010.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/674810\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1567433,"PostDate":1326399388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Wendy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am a newbie member to Best Destination Weddings.com and recently engaged 2 weeks ago!!! \u00a0I have read so many amazing things about you that I was hoping I could reach out to you to help us put together our destination wedding package in April 2013. From the sounds of it you are THE GURU & we would love to work with you if you would have us! \u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are looking to return to the Riu Palace Riviera Maya. \u00a0We vacationed there in April of 2010 with 4 other couples & absolutely loved it! \u00a0We anticipate a large group & really would like to get our information out there in good enough time so our family & friends can SAVE THE DATE and SAVE SOME MONEY and join us! \u00a0<3<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just sent a note to the wedding planner at the Riu Palace Riviera Maya last night to look into availability. \u00a0We know we want to go for a week in April 2013, we just need to confirm WHICH WEEK, my future stepson's Easter\/School break in 2013 will fall on. \u00a0Although Easter 2013 is Sunday March 31st, the school indicates they are unsure that the break will be that week of April 1st - 5th. \u00a0I should know by March at the latest.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I hope to hear from you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Many thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Elissa (& Bill)<\/strong><\/p> <p> elissae@nycap.rr.com<\/p> <p> Clifton Park, NY<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bill & I Riu 2010.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/674810\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong><em>Blissfully married since April 2, 2013. <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"elissae@nycap.rr.com","IpAddress":"208.105.149.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326386311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"elissae","Id":249789,"Name":"elissae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d854bc63f4dbcda55af0e84c0e4c51c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I agree, Wendy is great! I have been asking billions of questions and she has been consistent in being prompt.&amp;nbsp; I know when I e-mail her I won&#039;t be waiting days for a response. Pretty soon I will start getting the contract portion and it&#039;s good to know I&#039;m in good hands!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580003,"PostDate":1328744468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I agree, Wendy is great! I have been asking billions of questions and she has been consistent in being prompt.\u00a0 I know when I e-mail her I won't be waiting days for a response. Pretty soon I will start getting the contract portion and it's good to know I'm in good hands!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marilili18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1327079335,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250233.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marilili","Id":250233,"Name":"marilili","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9220c49ab544cd8d7d1385349217abce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Wendy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got your info from a friend and wanted to ask you for your contact info.&amp;nbsp; I have few questions:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1.&amp;nbsp; Is there a fee for your services?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2. What services do you provide?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3. Have you helped with weddings in Cancun?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married in October of this year and I am having a hard time deciding between few of the hotels.&amp;nbsp; My e-mail is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:sanelads@gmail.com\"&gt;sanelads@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sanela&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1600306,"PostDate":1332960708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Wendy,<\/p> <p> I got your info from a friend and wanted to ask you for your contact info.\u00a0 I have few questions:<\/p> <p> 1.\u00a0 Is there a fee for your services?<\/p> <p> 2. What services do you provide?<\/p> <p> 3. Have you helped with weddings in Cancun?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married in October of this year and I am having a hard time deciding between few of the hotels.\u00a0 My e-mail is <a href='mailto:sanelads@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>sanelads@gmail.com<\/a>.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks,<\/p> <p> Sanela<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sanelads@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332789985,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sanela Latic","Id":253219,"Name":"Sanela Latic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89407748e055adce325c4575f32a015b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Sanela,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for asking! My role as a TA is to book you and your guests either individually or as a group booking, to work with your guests to answer any\/all questions, coordinate the transfers from and back to the airport and assist with air if needed. Cancun\/ Riviera Maya is my area of expertise and where I assist with almost all of the weddings I work on.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There is no fee to you for my service as Travel Agents are paid commission from the Tour Operators, hotels and cruise lines we book for our clients.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would be very happy to answer your questions .. you can reach me at wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net if you like.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best regards,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1602701,"PostDate":1333400988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Sanela,<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for asking! My role as a TA is to book you and your guests either individually or as a group booking, to work with your guests to answer any\/all questions, coordinate the transfers from and back to the airport and assist with air if needed. Cancun\/ Riviera Maya is my area of expertise and where I assist with almost all of the weddings I work on.<\/p> <p> There is no fee to you for my service as Travel Agents are paid commission from the Tour Operators, hotels and cruise lines we book for our clients.<\/p> <p> I would be very happy to answer your questions .. you can reach me at wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net if you like.<\/p> <p> Best regards,<\/p> <p> TA Wendy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"515bdd2f68998df7bcb49632a5150646","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; am so glad to see them getting the \"props\" they deserve!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1625171,"PostDate":1338284347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> am so glad to see them getting the \"props\" they deserve!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aguonnhx@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1338198573,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Emma025","Id":255912,"Name":"Emma025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b0bd1113acefa832be27292db7da410","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I AGREE 100%!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We used Wendy, and she was AWESOME! Before we signed a contract with her, we had talked to the Resort TA, as well as FIVE other travel agents, and Wendy not only offered the lowest price and best package, but she was also the most friendly and on-the-ball! Every one of our guests that used her had nothing but fantastic things to say about their experience with her. Not only did she do a great job with all of the reservations, but she actually goes to the Cancun\/Riviera Maya area frequently, so she had lots of helpful tips about things to do down there!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We did have a few guests that chose to NOT to book through Wendy, and book their trip on their own, and they all had issues. One of them didn&#039;t get the kind of room they thought they were getting, one of them ended up in a building all the way across the resort from the rest of the guests (and I had to have them moved closer to us on the 2nd day of the trip, after they had already unpacked!), and the two other groups that didn&#039;t use Wendy never bothered to set up their own shuttle service (since Wendy just automatically did that for everyone who booked through her)... so they ended up taking taxis from the airport which cost almost twice as much as a shuttle.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Everyone who DID book through Wendy, however, had NO problems! Everything was taken care of, they all felt they had been given enough information to be really prepared, and they didn&#039;t have anything go wrong with any reservations.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yay, Wendy!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1636461,"PostDate":1340997743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I AGREE 100%!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We used Wendy, and she was AWESOME! Before we signed a contract with her, we had talked to the Resort TA, as well as FIVE other travel agents, and Wendy not only offered the lowest price and best package, but she was also the most friendly and on-the-ball! Every one of our guests that used her had nothing but fantastic things to say about their experience with her. Not only did she do a great job with all of the reservations, but she actually goes to the Cancun\/Riviera Maya area frequently, so she had lots of helpful tips about things to do down there!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We did have a few guests that chose to NOT to book through Wendy, and book their trip on their own, and they all had issues. One of them didn't get the kind of room they thought they were getting, one of them ended up in a building all the way across the resort from the rest of the guests (and I had to have them moved closer to us on the 2nd day of the trip, after they had already unpacked!), and the two other groups that didn't use Wendy never bothered to set up their own shuttle service (since Wendy just automatically did that for everyone who booked through her)... so they ended up taking taxis from the airport which cost almost twice as much as a shuttle.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Everyone who DID book through Wendy, however, had NO problems! Everything was taken care of, they all felt they had been given enough information to be really prepared, and they didn't have anything go wrong with any reservations.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yay, Wendy!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanieveillon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340994664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257278.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StephanieV","Id":257278,"Name":"StephanieV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"038effe3936b4a0d428f0916ac4a91c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Awww... thank you so much Stephanie! I loved working with you and your guests... what a nice group! Please let me know if I can be of help in the future for any of you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best wishes to you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TA Wendy\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1636493,"PostDate":1341003925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Awww... thank you so much Stephanie! I loved working with you and your guests... what a nice group! Please let me know if I can be of help in the future for any of you!<\/p> <p> Best wishes to you!<\/p> <p> TA Wendy<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58b8627a140ebb0512b9b4d79273d34d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My wedding isn&#039;t until next week, but I have to put my two cents in on the wonderful Wendy Hicks. &amp;nbsp;The reviews on here are all true...she is EXTREMELY helpful.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My wedding will have 50 people total and booked almost all of the guests (a couple chose to stay at a different resort). &amp;nbsp;We had guests cancelling, last minute guests booking the week before the wedding, and my fiance and I decided we didn&#039;t want to room together until the wedding night so our room count changed every night making everything very confusing. &amp;nbsp;Wendy handled it all without ever an issue and was very prompt in getting back to us every single day, even weekends!!! I sent her an email one Sunday afternoon and she called right after to answer my Mom and I&#039;s questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; She made the booking process seamless and stress-free for myself and my family. &amp;nbsp;In addition, she KNOWS Mexico and KNOWS Le Blanc Spa Resort. &amp;nbsp;It was comforting knowing she has booked several of these at the resort, visited, and knows how to work with the staff there. &amp;nbsp;Also the contract with her is the same as it is if you were to book with Palace Resorts, which I&#039;m VERY glad I didn&#039;t do.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I cannot say enough good things about her. &amp;nbsp;In addition, she was in California and we were on the East Coast and it was never an issue. &amp;nbsp;Don&#039;t think twice about using her!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PM me if you have any questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Molly&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1640845,"PostDate":1342122932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My wedding isn't until next week, but I have to put my two cents in on the wonderful Wendy Hicks. \u00a0The reviews on here are all true...she is EXTREMELY helpful.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My wedding will have 50 people total and booked almost all of the guests (a couple chose to stay at a different resort). \u00a0We had guests cancelling, last minute guests booking the week before the wedding, and my fiance and I decided we didn't want to room together until the wedding night so our room count changed every night making everything very confusing. \u00a0Wendy handled it all without ever an issue and was very prompt in getting back to us every single day, even weekends!!! I sent her an email one Sunday afternoon and she called right after to answer my Mom and I's questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> She made the booking process seamless and stress-free for myself and my family. \u00a0In addition, she KNOWS Mexico and KNOWS Le Blanc Spa Resort. \u00a0It was comforting knowing she has booked several of these at the resort, visited, and knows how to work with the staff there. \u00a0Also the contract with her is the same as it is if you were to book with Palace Resorts, which I'm VERY glad I didn't do.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I cannot say enough good things about her. \u00a0In addition, she was in California and we were on the East Coast and it was never an issue. \u00a0Don't think twice about using her!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> PM me if you have any questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Molly<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mollyefagan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315164948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244855.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":235,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"med2012","Id":244855,"Name":"med2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d0d861292480559e68ef91b6405cfd2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much Molly! I cant wait to hear back from you with your report in on your wedding at Le Blanc! It is certainly one of my very favorite resorts and I love being able to share it with my clients! It has been a pleasure working with you and your guests!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1643143,"PostDate":1342719747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much Molly! I cant wait to hear back from you with your report in on your wedding at Le Blanc! It is certainly one of my very favorite resorts and I love being able to share it with my clients! It has been a pleasure working with you and your guests!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":55,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
