ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878578'>Centrepieces<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1852686'>DIY - Giant Crepe Roses<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867378'>DIY - Hangers & Boutonnieres<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867696'>DIY - Kissing Menu\/I Spy & Guestbook<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/page-6#entry1878023'>More DIYs - Passport to Riviera Maya, Bookmarks, Tumbler Inserts, Luggage Tags, Keycard Holder Inserts, Something Special for You Inserts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"elsa_jam@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.16.109.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372291518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270962.png?_r=1397000926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Icis","Id":270962,"Name":"Icis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d43e0ee16803977313b1492551230f35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Icis,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am so sorry that I am not able to work with Canadian brides.. it is just that there are some great programs available to those coming from Canada that I am not able to sell from here in the States, so better for you to work with a Canadian agent if all your guests are from Canada.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We DO have a contact \/ affiliate agency in Canada that we here at BDW can refer you to if you fill out the Contact Me form, you will be put in touch!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best wishes to you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TA Wendy\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780498,"PostDate":1374256535,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Icis,<\/p> <p> I am so sorry that I am not able to work with Canadian brides.. it is just that there are some great programs available to those coming from Canada that I am not able to sell from here in the States, so better for you to work with a Canadian agent if all your guests are from Canada.<\/p> <p> We DO have a contact \/ affiliate agency in Canada that we here at BDW can refer you to if you fill out the Contact Me form, you will be put in touch!<\/p> <p> Best wishes to you!<\/p> <p> TA Wendy<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53004,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"663da34d09259ea06d88d44aa839bfc9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TA Wendy\"]\nHi Icis, I am so sorry that I am not able to work with Canadian brides.. it is just that there are some great programs available to those coming from Canada that I am not able to sell from here in the States, so better for you to work with a Canadian agent if all your guests are from Canada. We DO have a contact \/ affiliate agency in Canada that we here at BDW can refer you to if you fill out the Contact Me form, you will be put in touch! Best wishes to you! TA Wendy  [\/quote] awwww...why can&#039;t we just be one big happy family? Just kidding! Thanks so much for your reply. Although I won&#039;t be able to use your services, I&#039;ll refer my fellow US friends to you for their travel needs.","Attachments":[],"Id":1780582,"PostDate":1374267059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"TA Wendy\" url=\"\/t\/60163\/amazing&#045;bdw&#045;travel&#045;agent&#045;wendy&#045;hicks&#045;i&#045;highly&#045;recommend&#045;her\/30#post_1928567\"><p>Hi Icis, I am so sorry that I am not able to work with Canadian brides.. it is just that there are some great programs available to those coming from Canada that I am not able to sell from here in the States, so better for you to work with a Canadian agent if all your guests are from Canada. We DO have a contact \/ affiliate agency in Canada that we here at BDW can refer you to if you fill out the Contact Me form, you will be put in touch! Best wishes to you! TA Wendy \u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> awwww...why 