ay of and full wedding coordination and destination weddings. Although, I am located in Toronto, however, AffairyEvents is available for destination weddings in North America and Caribbean.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just came back from Mexico where we planned a gorgeous wedding for a couple that lives in Toronto, ON, Canada. Take a look at it here&amp;nbsp;http:\/\/affairyevents.com\/halyna-art-wedding-at-hacienda-corazon-puerto-aventuras-mexico\/&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354667823556_1232\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"174516\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/174516\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354667823556_1767\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"174517\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/174517\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For more information about AffairyEvents and our services, please visit www.affairyevents.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ksenia&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1692298,"PostDate":1354672002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, guys!<\/p> <p> I just wanted to let you know that I am WPIC certifiedwedding planner who specializes in day of and full wedding coordination and destination weddings. Although, I am located in Toronto, however, AffairyEvents is available for destination weddings in North America and Caribbean.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I just came back from Mexico where we planned a gorgeous wedding for a couple that lives in Toronto, ON, Canada. Take a look at it here\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/affairyevents.com\/halyna-art-wedding-at-hacienda-corazon-puerto-aventuras-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/affairyevents...enturas-mexico\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354667823556_1232\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"174516\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/174516\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354667823556_1767\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"174517\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/174517\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For more information about AffairyEvents and our services, please visit www.affairyevents.com\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ksenia<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"affairyevents@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1354671140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262942.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AffairyEvents","Id":262942,"Name":"AffairyEvents","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"71091","Title":"AffairyEvents Day of\/Full\/Destination Wedding Planner","LastPostDate":1354672002},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
