eing mothers.... the total is about $1400.00... For hair\/airbrush makeup\/lashes.. I am just now waiting to make sure it is okay with the resort to bring her in I can&#039;t imagine it is not but idk if she is considered an outside vendor..\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]meBonidie2be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n did you find someone?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1519520,"PostDate":1316006584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Been looking into Rachel Edwards.... check out her facebook page! Her prices are pretty reasonable!! I am paying for 11 women... one being a flower girl, and two being mothers.... the total is about $1400.00... For hair\/airbrush makeup\/lashes.. I am just now waiting to make sure it is okay with the resort to bring her in I can't imagine it is not but idk if she is considered an outside vendor..<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>meBonidie2be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> did you find someone?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298521181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"For