0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bb4c2bbb4783734c1888b9c78ab07a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m also looking into booking someone offsite&amp;nbsp;for hair\/makeup.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; At this point i&#039;m pretty sure its just for me... I was going to use the resort spa... but after mixed reviews and considering the cost... i figure it might be worth looking into someone mobile that can travel to the resort.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any recommendations?? or pictures??&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608342,"PostDate":1334674376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm also looking into booking someone offsite\u00a0for hair\/makeup.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> At this point i'm pretty sure its just for me... I was going to use the resort spa... but after mixed reviews and considering the cost... i figure it might be worth looking into someone mobile that can travel to the resort.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any recommendations?? or pictures??<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>May 10, 2012 Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton, Jamaica (46 Guests)<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alysia.schonewille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302018091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238543.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":193,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alysia85","Id":238543,"Name":"Alysia85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59924,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4615d9a34443c0c9d61078222e18a9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have Rachel Edwards booked... from everybody&#039;s reviews she is the one you want! Check her out on facebook&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608413,"PostDate":1334685503,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have Rachel Edwards booked... from everybody's reviews she is the one you want! Check her out on facebook<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298521181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sllefebvr","Id":237131,"Name":"Sllefebvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59924,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a966d60830c8d5222bb9e0378d2d0a80","RawContent":"Hey Sllefebvr, \n \n I actually did send her an email but unfortunately she is booked!!! :( \n She did reccomend I check out pretty faces or queen bee.... i liked pretty faces portfolio better.. from what was available. \n so i think i will send her an email and see. \n \n Rashel&#039;s work is unbelievable and the reviews are amazingly positive. You will definitely be a beautiful bride on your big day!\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sllefebvr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I have Rachel Edwards booked... from everybody&#039;s reviews she is the one you want! Check her out on facebook[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1608680,"PostDate":1334752484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Sllefebvr,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I actually did send her an email but unfortunately she is booked!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> She did reccomend I check out pretty faces or queen bee.... i liked pretty faces portfolio better.. from what was available.<\/p> <p> so i think i will send her an email and see.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Rashel's work is unbelievable and the reviews are amazingly positive. You will definitely be a beautiful bride on your big day!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sllefebvr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src