{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59924,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18bbe839f55d0defd0af0ba3dec5ebf9","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lkterry&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; Alysia85--Did you email pretty faces?&amp;nbsp; How did that work since the website says based out of South Florida?&amp;nbsp; Do you have to pay for the travel too?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; I did email pretty faces .. She quoted me about $500 after travel... however that did not include a day pass. That was wayyy too expensive.. so I didnt end up booking her. I did contact Rashel though... and she offered last minute...to send me her trainee.. sorry i cant remember her name off hand but i do have her business card somewhere. I paid $130 for her trainee to do airbrush makeup with eyelashes and it was stunning!! She was welllllllll worth it!!!! my makeup was so perfect and airbrush is definitely the way to go if you dont want your makeup to sweat off in 5 minutes!!! highly recommend booking through Rashel.. even if she is booked asked for her assistant!!! She was awesome.. so mcuh fun and very professional!","Attachments":[],"Id":1625630,"PostDate":1338371208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>lkterry<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p> Alysia85--Did you email pretty faces?\u00a0 How did that work since the website says based out of South Florida?\u00a0 Do you have to pay for the travel too?<\/p><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> I did email pretty faces .. She quoted me about $500 after travel... however that did not include a day pass. That was wayyy too expensive.. so I didnt end up booking her. I did contact Rashel though... and she offered last minute...to send me her trainee.. sorry i cant remember her name off hand but i do have her business card somewhere. I paid $130 for her trainee to do airbrush makeup with eyelashes and it was stunning!! She was welllllllll worth it!!!! my makeup was so perfect and airbrush is definitely the way to go if you dont want your makeup to sweat off in 5 minutes!!! highly recommend booking through Rashel.. even if she is booked asked for her assistant!!! She was awesome.. so mcuh fun and very professional!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>May 10, 2012 Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton, Jamaica (46 Guests)<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alysia.schonewille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302018091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238543.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":193,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alysia85","Id":238543,"Name":"Alysia85","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
