them? If anyone loved or hated them PLEASE let me know!! &lt;font face=\"Book Antiqua\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"3\"&gt;&lt;font color=\"Magenta\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile124.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile124\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n THANKS!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1190199,"PostDate":1277003187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone used Destinationweddings.com as their TA? I am about to book them and I really wanted some info about them... has anyone used them? If anyone loved or hated them PLEASE let me know!! <font face=\"Book Antiqua\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"Magenta\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile124.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile124\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/font><\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> THANKS!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"norma07@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275534454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228788.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"normamichelle","Id":228788,"Name":"normamichelle","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"140897f68dd1a555cbb42ff992c29490","RawContent":"Being a bride not too long ago, I can tell you that the travel agent you pick can save your sanity (or not!!). I went with a local Flight Centre TA, and I can tell you by the end of it I was ready to strangle someone (preferably her)--she caused me a lot of grief through the 9 month process re: booking errors, changing from a direct flight to a non-direct flight back to a direct flight, announcing to our guests that I was getting married to DH&#039;s brother on email etc.,. There has been some fairly mixed reviews about Destination Weddings.com, I suggest you do a search on the forum for them and decide for yourself. \n \n I can tell you though, if I were to do it all over again, I would have picked a TA from BDW!!\n Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1190212,"PostDate":1277005072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Being a bride not too long ago, I can tell you that the travel agent you pick can save your sanity (or not!!). I went with a local Flight Centre TA, and I can tell you by the end of it I was ready to strangle someone (preferably her)--she caused me a lot of grief through the 9 month process re: booking errors, changing from a direct flight to a non-direct flight back to a direct flight, announcing to our guests that I was getting married to DH's brother on email etc.,. There has been some fairly mixed reviews about Destination Weddings.com, I suggest you do a search on the forum for them and decide for yourself. <br \/> <br \/> I can tell you though, if I were to do it all over again, I would have picked a TA from BDW!!<br \/> Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Our Del Sol Wedding Pictures!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/our-la-zebra-tulum-wedding-pictures-del-sol-photography-59273\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ography-59273\/<\/a><br><br><span>My La Zebra Tulum Planning Thread<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/sita-nates-planning-thread-la-zebra-tulum-wedding-57763\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...wedding-57763\/<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i915.photobucket.com\/albums\/ac352\/Sita-Nate\/Wedding%20Pictures\/delsol.jpg\">http:\/\/i915.photobucket.com\/albums\/a...res\/delsol.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sitabita@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240611478,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217025.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sita&Nate","Id":217025,"Name":"Sita&Nate","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bb9e0cd4485279d243172b028e5b9b1","RawContent":"You should use the search, there is at least one very long thread about all the brides that used them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1190308,"PostDate":1277018014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style 